        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CF-5249, Smooth Half Circle Cabinet Cup Pull Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3 Inch Simple Half Circle Cup Pull is available in 8 great finishes including polished brass, satin nickel, polished chrome, and oil rubbed bronze. It is a great addition to any kitchen cabinet as it is easy to install and looks sleek and clean. This half circle cup pull made by RK International has a 3 inch center to center and 1-11/16 inch width so even big hands can get a firm hold on it.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CF-5249 Simple Cup Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Bass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
